@ID:	nld, eng, hin|corpus|MOT||female|||Mother|||
@ID:	nld, eng, hin|corpus|CHI|4;02.|male|||Target_Child|||
@Comment:	Constructs: multi-word code-switch spans, <...> [@s] and [@s:code]
@Comment:	The word-attached forms word@s and word@s:code are covered elsewhere
*CHI:	ik weet niet <how to do it> [@s] .
*MOT:	kijk <one two three> [@s:eng] .
*CHI:	<rocket@s:eng jaise jaataa hai> [@s:hin] .
@Comment:	The inner word marker wins over the span, which is attested usage
*MOT:	hallo [@s] .
@Comment:	One content item takes the annotation without angle brackets
